      "https://docs.oracle.com/en/industries/construction-engineering/primavera-p6-project/26/rest-api/op-project-put.html"
    ],
    "compatibility_rule": "The current-main-based candidate PR #1457 adds CPM-derived Late Start/Late Finish/Free Float values and model-derived Remaining Duration, plus documented numeric/alphabetic/blank Activity ID ordering for both forward and backward leveling. These changes remain pending exact-head CI and independent semantic review. Do not silently accept the four missing priority fields or Hierarchy sort, and do not claim full P6 PriorityList parity while ordered-row/wire round-trip acceptance is unverified.",
    "source_version": "P6 Professional User Guide Version 26; relevant online pages last published 2026-05-29",
    "documented_rules": [
      {
        "rule": "Priority row order is precedence order: each row takes precedence over every row below it. Priority rows are used only when multiple activities compete for the same resource at the same time.",
        "evidence": "https://docs.oracle.com/cd/G48902_01/English/User_Guides/p6_pro_user/specify_leveling_priorities.htm",
        "status": "verified_release_26"
      },
      {
        "rule": "If multiple activities are ready for leveling, the leveler applies the configured priority rows. For Activity ID ordering, number-like values sort before alphabetic values and blanks; when no priority codes are configured, Activity ID is the default.",
        "evidence": "https://docs.oracle.com/cd/G48902_01/English/User_Guides/p6_pro_user/leveling_priority_definitions.htm",
        "status": "verified_release_26"
      },
      {
        "rule": "The documented priority table has 13 fields and supports ascending and descending; Hierarchy appears only for hierarchical fields. The current Shared Core boundary exposes nine field values and two sort directions; four documented fields and Hierarchy remain unimplemented.",
        "evidence": "https://docs.oracle.com/cd/G48902_01/client_help/en_US/level_resources_dialog_box.htm",
        "status": "documented_gap_until_all_fields_and_hierarchy_are_supported"
      }
    ]
